      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXX} To fundes cildes fostre: ðy forman geare geselle VI sciƚƚ, ðy æfterran XII, ðy ðriddan XXX, siððan be his wlite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For the fostering of a foundling: for the first year give 6 shillings; for the next, 12; for the third, 30; and afterwards according to his appearance.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">For the maintenance of a foundling 6 shillings shall be given in the first year, 12 shillings in the second, 30 shillings in the third, and afterwards [sums] according to his appearance.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">To fundenes cyldes fostre, ðy forman geare gesylle VI scll', ⁊ ðy æfteran geare XII, ⁊ ðy ðriddan XX, ⁊ siððan be his wlite.</ab>
      </div>
